{"id":"81cce59764da5536","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-incompressibility.md","title":"Incompressibility","display":"df-incompressibility — Incompressibility","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-incompressibility","aliases":["58-df-incompressibility"],"display":"df-incompressibility — Incompressibility","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-incompressibility"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-incompressibility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-incompressibility — Incompressibility"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b\" href=\"?note=c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md\">../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau_X)\">\\((X,\\tau_X)\\)</span> (topological space), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X\">\\(A\\subseteq X\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_A\\coloneqq\\{U\\cap A:U\\in\\tau_X\\}\">\\(\\tau_A\\coloneqq\\{U\\cap A:U\\in\\tau_X\\}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_0\\in A\">\\(a_0\\in A\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1\">\\(\\pi_1\\)</span> (fundamental group, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b\" href=\"?note=c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md\">../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}\\)</span> (injectivity predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Incompressible}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Incompressible}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (incompressibility predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}incompressibility}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Incompressible}_S(A,X,\\tau_X,a_0)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land a_0\\in A\n\\land\\exists i,j\\;\\Bigl(\ni=\\{\\langle a,a\\rangle:a\\in A\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land j=\\{\\langle[\\gamma],[i\\circ\\gamma]\\rangle:\\gamma\\in\\Omega(A,\\tau_A,a_0)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Injective}\\bigl(j,\\pi_1(A,\\tau_A,a_0),\\pi_1(X,\\tau_X,a_0)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}incompressibility}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Incompressible}_S(A,X,\\tau_X,a_0)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land a_0\\in A\n\\land\\exists i,j\\;\\Bigl(\ni=\\{\\langle a,a\\rangle:a\\in A\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land j=\\{\\langle[\\gamma],[i\\circ\\gamma]\\rangle:\\gamma\\in\\Omega(A,\\tau_A,a_0)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Injective}\\bigl(j,\\pi_1(A,\\tau_A,a_0),\\pi_1(X,\\tau_X,a_0)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The subspace topology and the induced homomorphism <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\gamma]\\mapsto[i\\circ\\gamma]\">\\([\\gamma]\\mapsto[i\\circ\\gamma]\\)</span> are explicit; for path-connected spaces the resulting property is independent of the chosen base point up to conjugacy.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-injective.md","status":"resolved","id":"8317eefb4572709e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\pi_1$ (fundamental group, see [[../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S$ (topological-space predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-injective.md","status":"resolved","id":"8317eefb4572709e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Injective}$ (injectivity predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\tau_X)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_A\\coloneqq\\{U\\cap A:U\\in\\tau_X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"a_0\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Injective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Incompressible}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}incompressibility}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{Incompressible}_S(A,X,\\tau_X,a_0)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land a_0\\in A\n\\land\\exists i,j\\;\\Bigl(\ni=\\{\\langle a,a\\rangle:a\\in A\\}\\\\\n&\\land j=\\{\\langle[\\gamma],[i\\circ\\gamma]\\rangle:\\gamma\\in\\Omega(A,\\tau_A,a_0)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Injective}\\bigl(j,\\pi_1(A,\\tau_A,a_0),\\pi_1(X,\\tau_X,a_0)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"[\\gamma]\\mapsto[i\\circ\\gamma]","display":false}],"bytes":1531,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-663","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-incompressibility.md|58-df-incompressibility]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b","8317eefb4572709e","815e63e5071e7b58"]}